-- Dialy: drop piece counts and pack sizes from food names so the KH-Rechner
-- shows the food, not the package, e.g. "4 Bio-Eier" -> "Bio-Eier",
-- "Giotto Haselnuss (9 Stück)" -> "Giotto Haselnuss",
-- "Actimel Multifrucht 8 x 100g" -> "Actimel Multifrucht".
--
-- Only Open Food Facts rows carry such counts (BLS/BLV names are generic).
-- Leading numbers that belong to the product are kept ("5-Korn-Flocken",
-- "75% Aprikose Konfiture", "1-2-3 Frites"). Translations in `names`
-- contain no counts and are left alone.
--
-- Explicit list (id, current name, new name) instead of a regex so every
-- change is reviewable. A row is only updated if its name is still the one
-- listed, so later edits in the Dialy-Editor are not overwritten.
-- The foods_touch_updated_at trigger (0010) bumps updated_at, so the app pulls
-- the cleaned rows on its next sync.

